 +-----------+       Request        +-----------+        Query         +-----------+
  |           | ------------------>  |           | ------------------>  |           |
  |  Client   |                      |   Server  |                      |  Database |
  | (Browser) | <------------------  | (Backend) | <------------------  | (Data)    |
  +-----------+       Response       +-----------+        Response      +-----------+
          \                                                     
           \                                                   
            \-->   External APIs (for payment, map, weather, etc.)

Explanation:
Client sends request (e.g., login) to the server.


Server interacts with the database and APIs to get data.


Response is sent back to the client and displayed in the browser.


